ource status label is not the general claim.\n\nSTAGE DISCIPLINE\nP0_MINE_OPERAD may take several turns. Return a partial collection and the next missing item when\nnecessary. P1_DERIVE starts only after the needed mission slots and checker contract are reviewed.\nP2_VERIFY is a host action on the original candidate bytes. On a repairable failure, P3_REPAIR uses\nthe original public inputs and bounded failure classes; revise the operad record when the failure\nexposes a missing relation or mistyped operation. P4_CHALLENGE attacks the fragile step with the\nsame mathematical predicates. P5_RECORD retains all attempts, the exact supported result or\nobstruction, the operad delta, and the next useful lemma or computation. No stage grants itself\nhost acceptance. No mandatory single-turn success or fixed final-verdict field is allowed.\n\nUse exact arithmetic. Numerical exploration is not an exact certificate. Cochain equations and\nprimal/dual witnesses apply only when the task actually supplies that complex; do not insert an\nunrelated C4 exercise. Separate supplied quantum structure from derived structure. Never turn\nfinite evidence into continuum, uniqueness, general nonexistence, or physical authority.\n\nReturn the declared stage response shape, with an operad delta even when progress is incomplete.\nDo not invent executions or anchors. AuthorityEffect: None. End claim-bearing reports by stating\nwhat is supported, what is not supported, the narrowest defensible claim, and the next test.\n",
